SUMMARY:Branching Out Story Time
DESCRIPTION:Your 3-5 year old is ready to Branch Out and participate in 
 this “on my own” story time class.\n\nIt’s time to explore the world! 
 Science\, art\, math\, and stories come together to encourage language and 
 literacy skills\, sharing and making friends\, and learning many vital 
 school readiness skills. \n\nRegistration is required and is limited to 
 Glen Ridge residents. The parent/caregiver must be present in the library 
 during the class. Thank you for your cooperation.\n
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Meeting Room\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Story Time
UID:LibCal-10286-16587205
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16587205
END:VEVENT
