DTSTART:20260708T220000Z
DTEND:20260708T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260708T000000Z
SUMMARY:Library Chef Junior: Blueberry Muffins
DESCRIPTION:Kids ages 5 and up are invited to join Library Chef Junior for 
 a fun LIVE ONLINE cooking class celebrating National Picnic 
 Month!\n\nTogether\, we'll learn how to make soft\, sweet Blueberry Muffins 
 that are perfect for picnics\, snacks\, breakfast\, or sharing with family 
 and friends.\n\n
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Class
UID:LibCal-10286-17066400
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17066400
