SUMMARY:10th Annual Town Wide Yard Sale
DESCRIPTION:Start cleaning out your attic\, garage\, and closets\, and join 
 us at the 10th Annual Glen Ridge Town-Wide Yard Sale! This year's sale is 
 Saturday\, September 26\, 2026 from 9:00 am - 4:00 pm. The event will be 
 held rain or shine.\n\nThe registration fee for 2026 is $25.00 and is 
 nonrefundable. In the event of rain\, registrants can choose to hold a Yard 
 Sale on a different date instead until December 31\, 2026 with no 
 additional fees. Online registration requires a credit or debit card. When 
 paying by card\, you will be charged a fee from Eventbrite. To avoid this 
 fee\, you may pay by check or cash at the Library. If you prefer to pay by 
 check or cash\, please print and complete this form\, and bring payment to 
 the Glen Ridge Public Library by Wednesday\, September 23 at 3:00 pm. Make 
 checks payable to "Friends of the Glen Ridge Library." Blank forms are 
 available at the Library's Adult Desk.\n\nWhat's included in the 
 registration fee? Extensive advertising via local newspapers i.e.\, Star 
 Ledger\, The Record\, and local town papers (both print and online)\; 
 social media\; online event calendars\; online classified ads\; email 
 blasts\; and flyers posted in businesses. Your address will be listed on 
 the official sale map and in a custom Google Map. You will also receive an 
 official Town-Wide Yard Sale sign for your home.\n\nAll proceeds generated 
 from fees support the Friends of the Glen Ridge Library\, a registered 
 501(c)3 non-profit organization. Thank you for your support. Yard sale 
 information and links to registration can also be found on the Glen Ridge 
 Library's website. www.glenridgelibrary.org/yardsale
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Friends of the Library
UID:LibCal-10286-17347515
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17347515
END:VEVENT
