SUMMARY:Tech Time 101 - Drop-in
DESCRIPTION:Bring your device and questions to the library for basic 
 one-on-one assistance session. Build your tech confidence through learning 
 how to download apps\, access your camera and photos\, or customize your 
 device's settings for ideal usage.\n\nPlease note\, these sessions are for 
 basic guidance and not for in-depth IT services\; we are unable to repair 
 computers or smartphones. Some technological issues may be above the 
 ability of the library staff and you may be referred out to a better suited 
 tech professional.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Adult Reading Room\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Technology
